      <marc:subfield code="a">“Appāviṉ Kaikkaṭikāram” is a compelling collection of 42 short stories that delve into the diverse challenges of modern life. Each story offers a poignant look at family issues, workplace conflicts, the struggles of today&apos;s youth, and the hardships faced during times of war. Through relatable characters and thought-provoking narratives, this anthology captures the essence of human resilience and the complexities of navigating everyday life. Perfect for readers seeking both reflection and insight, these stories will resonate deeply and leave a lasting impression.</marc:subfield>
